<title>UK: John Laing says makes good start in 1997.</title>
<headline>John Laing says makes good start in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction company John Laing Plc said on Thursday that it had got off to a promising start in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;As you will be aware, we have been following a consistent strategy for several years and this is producing good results,&quot; chairman Martin Laing chairman told the annual meeting.</p>
</text>
